            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O manipulador espera apenas um texto de assento inválido. Qual trabalho deve ser movido para fora deste bloco <code>try</code> grande demais?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  seats = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = seats * form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_booking(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O cálculo do total e a chamada de <code>save_booking()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A conversão com <code>int()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O manipulador de <code>ValueError</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">O corpo inteiro da função</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O cálculo do total e a chamada de <code>save_booking()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
