            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A reserva tem uma chave <code>\"seats\"</code>, mas o texto dela pode ser inválido. Complete o manipulador específico do chamador em torno de <code>parse_seats()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"process_booking\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(booking)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    seats = parse_seats(booking[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" seats\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>"
